<title>USA: CB Commercial Q4 shr rises.</title>
<headline>CB Commercial Q4 shr rises.</headline>
<dateline>LOS ANGELES 1997-01-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>1996			1995</p>
<p> Shr primary		$1.74		    $0.66</p>
<p> Shr diluted		 1.68		     0.66</p>
<p> Net			 25,154		    9,054</p>
<p> Revs		     192,205		  143,570</p>
<p> Avg shrs		  15,012		   13,664</p>
<p>		 Year</p>
<p> Shr primary		$5.02		    $0.55</p>
<p> Shr diluted		 4.97		     0.55</p>
<p> Net			 70,549		    7,409</p>
<p> Revs		     583,068		  468,460</p>
<p> Avg shrs		  14,184		   13,540</p>
<p>(All data above 000s except per share numbers)</p>
<p>NOTE: 1996 Q4 results include benefit of net operating loss carryover, recognized in the third and fourth quarters. Benefit in Q4 was $15.5 million vs $4.3 million, and for year was $55.9 million vs $3.3 million.</p>
